    {
      "number": 52,
      "text": "Key Factors\n\nCustom Retry:\n- Needs testing\n- Needs maintenance\n- Subject to bugs",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 53,
      "text": "Key Factors\n\n\n\n        Caching: None by default",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 54,
      "text": "Key Factors\n\n\n\n  State: Complex to manage globally and\n          handle data staleness",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 55,
      "text": "Key Factors\n\n\n\nData Mapping: E ort on the client (potential\n         need for memoization)\n\n\n\n\n               ff",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 56,
      "text": "Key Factors\n\n\n\n   Payload: Not optimized for state and\n                caching",
      "images": []
