      "text": "Function as a Service\n\nAverage Ingress Bandwidth: 1-5 Gbps\n\nExamples: AWS Lamba, Vercel Edge Functions, Cloud are Workers\n\nNote: Cold start times (100ms-2s) may impact performance; functions\ntypically stay \"hot\" for 5-60 minutes depending on provider and tra c\npatterns\n\n\n\n                                                               ffi\n                                                   fl",
