      "text": "Infrastructure as a Service\n\nAverage Ingress Bandwidth: 2-25 Gbps\n\nExamples: AWS EC2, GCP Compute Engine, Azure VMs\n\nNote: Always running, no cold start penalty; bandwidth scales with\ninstance size",
